This repository is publicly accessible for technical review, evaluation,
reference, discussion, and documentation of the Veil Routing Protocol
("VRP") architecture.

Public availability of this repository does not make VRP open source.

Except for the limited permissions expressly granted below, no copyright,
patent, trademark, trade-secret, implementation, distribution,
commercialization, sublicensing, or other intellectual-property rights
are granted by publication of this repository.

